        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 3:36PM EDT until September 28 at 4:00AM EDT by NWS Buffalo NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 15 to 20 knots and waves 3 to 6 feet
expected.

* WHERE...The nearshore waters from the Niagara River to Hamlin
Beach.

* WHEN...From 5 AM Sunday to 4 AM EDT Monday.

* IMPACTS...Winds and/or waves will cause hazardous conditions
that could capsize or damage small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
